{{ ref: 37db2572-f788-810a-97b7-df8473ed1f0e }}
## 📋 Non-Functional Requirements
--{ ref: 37db2572-f788-810a-97b7-df8473ed1f0e }--

{{ ref: 37db2572-f788-8199-992f-c53c735797a4, is_toggleable: true }}
### NFR-1: Determinism
  {{ ref: 37db2572-f788-812f-b83e-f0a039e6e86a }}
  **Requirement**: Identical snapshot + config + seed produces byte-identical output, across runs and machines.
  --{ ref: 37db2572-f788-812f-b83e-f0a039e6e86a }--
  {{ ref: 37db2572-f788-81c1-9655-e72a6837d90e }}
  **Implementation**:
  --{ ref: 37db2572-f788-81c1-9655-e72a6837d90e }--
  {{ ref: 37db2572-f788-81d1-83e0-de2ac88310d2 }}
  - Fixed default seed (42); ordered iteration everywhere (no hash-map iteration-order leaks); deterministic parallel reductions
  --{ ref: 37db2572-f788-81d1-83e0-de2ac88310d2 }--
  {{ ref: 9e421378-731b-43d0-90c9-83910e4622ff }}
  - HiGHS pinned by the lockfile; ILP edge weights integer-scaled before solving so optima never depend on float rounding
  --{ ref: 9e421378-731b-43d0-90c9-83910e4622ff }--
  {{ ref: 8d1e41d4-4733-40da-a37f-56cc2b8762ea }}
  - Canonical float formatting (shortest round-trip representation) in all serialized output
  --{ ref: 8d1e41d4-4733-40da-a37f-56cc2b8762ea }--
  {{ ref: 37db2572-f788-81ca-b64a-dfcdad43aa1b }}
  **Rationale**: Results must be reviewable, diffable, and CI-stable.
  --{ ref: 37db2572-f788-81ca-b64a-dfcdad43aa1b }--
--{ ref: 37db2572-f788-8199-992f-c53c735797a4 }--

{{ ref: 37db2572-f788-811a-ba57-dc44361fef4b, is_toggleable: true }}
### NFR-2: Honest Uncertainty
  {{ ref: 37db2572-f788-8154-8712-c099f8480108 }}
  **Requirement**: Heuristic results are never presented as exact — MFAS suggestions carry an `exact` flag; low-confidence edges carry their confidence.
  --{ ref: 37db2572-f788-8154-8712-c099f8480108 }--
  {{ ref: 37db2572-f788-8152-9912-dcaa46d53743 }}
  **Implementation**:
  --{ ref: 37db2572-f788-8152-9912-dcaa46d53743 }--
  {{ ref: 37db2572-f788-810b-9cc1-ed13e0f52625 }}
  - `exact: false` on heuristic break suggestions; `confidence < 1.0` propagated from binders into scoring
  --{ ref: 37db2572-f788-810b-9cc1-ed13e0f52625 }--
  {{ ref: 37db2572-f788-81ad-ba26-d43c700304f4 }}
  **Rationale**: Overstated certainty in an advisory tool destroys trust faster than missing features.
  --{ ref: 37db2572-f788-81ad-ba26-d43c700304f4 }--
--{ ref: 37db2572-f788-811a-ba57-dc44361fef4b }--

