{{ ref: 37db2572-f788-81b1-b6d9-e54841b14b61 }}
## 🔐 Security Considerations
--{ ref: 37db2572-f788-81b1-b6d9-e54841b14b61 }--

{{ ref: 37db2572-f788-8152-af48-e2ce8081e5ae, is_toggleable: true }}
### SR-1: Fully Offline Analysis
  {{ ref: cdb9f804-77e1-4c30-b3a4-2bed7a982485 }}
  **Requirement**: No network calls, ever — Strata ships no server component; analysis is fully local via the CLI or the embedded library.
  --{ ref: cdb9f804-77e1-4c30-b3a4-2bed7a982485 }--
  {{ ref: b9e55bb4-f3e0-4cbc-989d-e21bc30056ed }}
  **Implementation**:
  --{ ref: b9e55bb4-f3e0-4cbc-989d-e21bc30056ed }--
  {{ ref: f88c69c7-d573-4560-adf4-75718523acb1 }}
  - No network dependencies anywhere in the workspace; the library consumes local sources or pre-built IR snapshots only
  --{ ref: f88c69c7-d573-4560-adf4-75718523acb1 }--
  {{ ref: 9f7a69e9-a250-4b9e-ae27-d99f2fa34bba }}
  **Rationale**: The tool reads entire proprietary codebases — its trust story must be trivial.
  --{ ref: 9f7a69e9-a250-4b9e-ae27-d99f2fa34bba }--
--{ ref: 37db2572-f788-8152-af48-e2ce8081e5ae }--

