{{ ref: 37db2572-f788-814e-a3d0-d4f9e581875f }}
## ⚡ Performance & Scalability
--{ ref: 37db2572-f788-814e-a3d0-d4f9e581875f }--

{{ ref: 00b2600a-4cce-46ff-a286-f9f2850c80fc, is_toggleable: true }}
### PR-1: Monorepo-Scale Budget
  {{ ref: de87b890-c420-41b7-9f96-35ae98098f54 }}
  **Requirement**: A 100k-symbol, ~500k-edge monorepo completes end-to-end on an 8-core developer machine within budget.
  --{ ref: de87b890-c420-41b7-9f96-35ae98098f54 }--
  {{ ref: eca212e0-512e-4b23-b239-e1632ee134fa }}
  **Implementation**:
  --{ ref: eca212e0-512e-4b23-b239-e1632ee134fa }--
  {{ ref: e8e2b045-3d3c-47ba-9da2-5de066ddabb6 }}
  - CSR adjacency with interned identifiers; rayon-parallel parsing, per-SCC shattering, and multi-start diversification
  --{ ref: e8e2b045-3d3c-47ba-9da2-5de066ddabb6 }--
  {{ ref: 7b3661d1-9400-40d3-8a65-bd349318ebdc }}
  - Multilevel (not flat) clustering; linear phases strictly O(V + E)
  --{ ref: 7b3661d1-9400-40d3-8a65-bd349318ebdc }--
  {{ ref: 8c88fc62-2cf6-4596-9f0d-b86b0fcc3a51 }}
  **Metrics**:
  --{ ref: 8c88fc62-2cf6-4596-9f0d-b86b0fcc3a51 }--
  {{ ref: abaa8fc4-6fd6-4e42-ae84-a4f3354430c4 }}
  - Core pipeline (post-parse) ≤ 60 s — **inclusive of the 10·k multi-start at k = 3, both modes**
  --{ ref: abaa8fc4-6fd6-4e42-ae84-a4f3354430c4 }--
  {{ ref: 95c7587a-4d5a-41ed-9dc3-0dd26cd5f6d2 }}
  - Candidate-free `violations` path (post-parse) ≤ 10 s
  --{ ref: 95c7587a-4d5a-41ed-9dc3-0dd26cd5f6d2 }--
  {{ ref: 5be474ed-f0c8-4c35-ad8a-a4c7a0729cac }}
  - End-to-end including parsing ≤ 5 min
  --{ ref: 5be474ed-f0c8-4c35-ad8a-a4c7a0729cac }--
  {{ ref: 88d7ebbd-3095-4a6a-b562-2b149a45de97 }}
  - Peak memory ≤ 4 GiB
  --{ ref: 88d7ebbd-3095-4a6a-b562-2b149a45de97 }--
  {{ ref: 2c55501d-8942-47a4-945c-faeed914e232 }}
  **Rationale**: A tool developers won't wait for is a tool developers won't run.
  --{ ref: 2c55501d-8942-47a4-945c-faeed914e232 }--
--{ ref: 00b2600a-4cce-46ff-a286-f9f2850c80fc }--

