## 🧪 Test Strategy
--{ ref: 37db2572-f788-8148-bb9b-e8cde0269dea }--

{{ ref: 37db2572-f788-819a-9c61-dfd52083e786, is_toggleable: true }}
### Test Matrix
  {{ ref: 37db2572-f788-8150-8679-c75fedd4b007, table_width: 4 }}
  | **Scenario**                | **Input**                                                        | **Expected Output**                                                           | **Priority** |
  | --------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- | -------- |
  | Clean DAG repo              | Fixture repo: no cycles, all files under cap                     | Zero violations; anchored candidate 1 ≈ current layout                        | Critical |
  | Two-symbol cycle            | Fixture with one mutual import                                   | One cycle violation with exact break suggestion                               | Critical |
  | Over-cap SCC                | Cyclic group totalling 600 SLOC                                  | Conditional split with MFAS preconditions; no cyclic file split               | Critical |
  | Polarity breach             | Production file importing a test fixture                         | Polarity violation; exit 2 under --fail-on polarity                           | Critical |
  | Oversized symbol            | Single 400-SLOC function                                         | Oversized-symbol flag; file exempt from capacity violation                    | High     |
  | Barrel-heavy repo           | Deep re-export chains                                            | Edges resolve to true targets; no barrel hub nodes                            | High     |
  | Mixed test conventions      | Co-located specs in one package, mirrored test folder in another | Per-package convention detected and echoed; projection follows each           | High     |
  | 100k-symbol synthetic graph | Generated snapshot at scale                                      | Core pipeline within 60 s and 4 GiB (k = 3, both modes, multi-start included) | Medium   |
  | Determinism cross-check     | Same snapshot + seed on two machines                             | Byte-identical results                                                        | Critical |
  --{ ref: 37db2572-f788-8150-8679-c75fedd4b007 }--
--{ ref: 37db2572-f788-819a-9c61-dfd52083e786 }--

